            "text-align": "justify",
            "text-indent": "22.5pt"
          },
          "table": null,
          "text": "Fluctuations in our Google subscriptions, platforms, and devices revenues have been, and may continue to be, affected by factors in addition to the general factors described above, such as changes in customer usage and demand, number of subscribers, and the timing of product launches.",
          "text_hash": "0f75b1a668e8b80e4813bc8585f836fa3df9fa019194ec0da10419e8dec2b9fc",
          "type": "paragraph"
        },
        {
